  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_8e61e69cc8d94afb887f54bfa3190acc",
      "statement": "Enrollment is a 5-step client wizard (JS.html) that submits to processEnrollment (Action.gs); the server resolves the user by email, mints an EN- transaction id, upserts the Enrollments row, appends the Beneficiaries ledger row, appends an Audit_Log row, then runs best-effort post-commit side-effects (generateLetter, sendActionConfirmation, patchAuditEventData, sendLetterFailureAlert, trackFeatureAction) that never roll back the committed enrollment.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://Code/Action.gs#L4-L172",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:892fdd50976c37a82d0fada0b01450797dc9443b5775ef598fa7379e37be80df:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://html/JS.html#L411-L434",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2f1f56ed36e9a2e6c85797b36fc56ff06734fa23f4cfa8bed84952c2ca176699:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f4909673a32f40a1ba8d464a6274e26b",
      "statement": "The wizard has 5 steps gated by validateStep: step 1 contribution rate (contribution !== null), step 2 investment plan (investment !== null), step 3 beneficiaries (each card filled, pct >= 1, sum exactly 100), step 4 review (always valid), step 5 drawn signature (!PFSignature.isEmpty(wizSigHandle)). wizardNext advances or, on step 5, calls submitEnrollWizard.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://html/JS.html#L342-L398",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4bebb5dc3ac0c6f7aeb9092c4abb974930615415f1cf5e08f9de77920a276d15:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a312133ed09d418894e73e92727547e3",
      "statement": "Beneficiary names carry a transient UI-only title prefix; mergePrefixes folds {prefix, name, ...} into {name: 'prefix name', ...} right before JSON.stringify on submit, so the stored JSON model stays {name, rel, pct, address}. These fragments (prefixOptions, relOptions, mergePrefixes, splitPrefix, PREFIX_LIST) are shared with the beneficiary manager.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://html/JS.html#L264-L293",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0e80f279c7ec9ccadbdb5a2be7260c78683d1bf75ba424444eec5c1b21a0db7c:"
