      "statement": "Step 5 mounts a fresh PFSignature pad on #wizSigCanvas with validateStep as the endStroke callback; PFSignature.getDataUrl trims the export to the ink's bounding box (scanning alpha in device pixels) and falls back to the full-canvas export. The wizard owns its own handle (wizSigHandle), destroyed on open/close to avoid leaks.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://html/JS.html#L204-L212",
