      "statement": "submitEnrollWizard builds payload { contributionPlan, investmentPlan, beneficiariesJSON (mergePrefixes stringified), sigDataUrl } and calls google.script.run.processEnrollment(payload, navigator.userAgent); on success it closes the wizard, toasts, and sets pendingFeedbackAction='Enroll' for the post-action feedback prompt.",
