    {
      "id": "claim_a086e49d020149e2a188d9d0b114eae1",
      "statement": "On upsert of the Enrollments row, wasFirstEnrollment is true only if the existing First_Enrolled_Date is blank (re-enroll) or no row exists (first enroll); First_Enrolled_Date is written only when it was blank (never overwritten), Current_Enrolled_Date is always set to today on every enrollment, and Current_Plan/Investment_Plan are overwritten. A first-enroll row also initializes Withdrawal_Count to 0.",
