      "id": "claim_0bc4b551b2644c42baa8ba9fb5fffafc",
      "statement": "After the sheet writes, processEnrollment runs the best-effort pipeline: generateLetter('ENROLLMENT', ctx, sigDataUrl) wrapped in try/catch (the only throwing step, capturing letterError), sendActionConfirmation (never throws, returns sent/error), patchAuditEventData stamping letterFileId/letterError/emailSent/emailError/signedAt onto the audit row (never throws), sendLetterFailureAlert only if letterError is set (never throws), and trackFeatureAction('enroll','success',device). The handler returns {success:true} regardless of side-effect failures.",
